# Echoly extension — env override template. You usually do NOT need this:
#
#   • `wxt dev` / `wxt build --mode development`  → loads `.env.development`
#     (committed, points at localhost:8787 / localhost:4321). Works out of the
#     box with `make dev-server` + `make dev-web`.
#   • `wxt build` / `wxt zip` (production)        → reads NO .env file; falls
#     back to prod URLs hard-coded in src/shared/constants.ts.
#
# Use this template only if you want PER-USER overrides:
#   • `.env.development.local`  → overrides committed dev defaults (gitignored).
#   • `.env.local`              → applies to all modes (gitignored).
#
# `WXT_*` prefix is required for build-time-exposed values (WXT/Vite docs).

# WXT_ECHOLY_API_ORIGIN=http://localhost:8787
# WXT_ECHOLY_WEB_ORIGIN=http://localhost:4321
